      "subject": "Malaysian answer: hujung bulan",
      "conclusion": "Correct and ordinary for Malaysian Malay; PRPM/Kamus Dewan defines hujung bulan as akhir bulan and gives related end-of-month usage.",
      "material_risk": false,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://prpm.dbp.gov.my/Cari1?d=73980&keyword=Hujung+bulan",
